stream
BT
/F1 9 Tf
12 TL
1 0 0 1 36 806 Tm
(RELEASE ENGINEERING ADDENDUM A - ROUNDING, PRECEDENCE AND ADMISSION) Tj
T*
(Release R-NEXT. This addendum is normative. Where the handbook and this) Tj
T*
(addendum state the same rule, the two agree; where only this addendum) Tj
T*
(states a rule, this addendum is the authority.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(A1. COST SCALING ORDER) Tj
T*
(  A unit cost is built in four ordered steps and each step rounds up to a) Tj
T*
(  whole tick before the next step reads it.) Tj
T*
(    step 1  platform scaling    c1 = ceil\(c0 * num / den\)) Tj
T*
(    step 2  regeneration        c2 = ceil\(c1 * rnum / rden\)) Tj
T*
(    step 3  cold cache          c3 = ceil\(c2 * knum / kden\)) Tj
T*
(    step 4  kind minimum        c4 = max\(c3, minimum_cost_ticks\)) Tj
T*
(  c0 is base_cost_ticks from the component register. The step 1 fraction) Tj
T*
(  comes from the platform_scaling sheet of the capacity workbook, the step) Tj
T*
(  2 and step 3 fractions from its cost_rules sheet, and the step 4 floor) Tj
T*
(  from build_cost_rules.jsonl.) Tj
T*
(  Step 2 applies when the unit kind takes the regeneration surcharge and) Tj
T*
(  the unit carries contract_changed or generated_interface_rebuilt.) Tj
T*
(  Step 3 applies when the unit kind takes the cold cache multiplier and) Tj
T*
(  the unit carries absent_from_previous_release.) Tj
T*
(  Step 4 never lifts a unit whose base_cost_ticks is 0. A zero cost unit) Tj
T*
(  stays at cost 0 and is still a build unit.) Tj
T*
(  Collapsing the steps into one multiplication with a single final rounding) Tj
T*
(  is not the documented arithmetic and does not give the documented result.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(A2. CEILING DIVISION) Tj
T*
(  For integers a >= 0 and b > 0, ceil\(a / b\) = \(a + b - 1\) // b.) Tj
T*
(  No stage uses floating point. A fraction with denominator 0 is a row) Tj
T*
(  defect: the row is ignored and E_NON_INTEGER is recorded.) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
endobj
