1 0 0 1 36 806 Tm
(A8. PRIORITY CLASS OVERRIDES) Tj
T*
(  The table below is the authority for the priority class of the components) Tj
T*
(  it names. A component named here takes the priority_class of its active) Tj
T*
(  row with the highest revision_seq, and the component register value) Tj
T*
(  applies to every component this table does not name.) Tj
T*
(  A row whose state reads superseded is not applied. A row naming a) Tj
T*
(  component that is absent from the register is ignored under) Tj
T*
(  E_UNKNOWN_UNIT. A row whose component_id is not in canonical upper case) Tj
T*
(  form is ignored under E_ID_FORM.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(  component_id  priority_class  state  revision_seq) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
endobj
